  </div>
  <div class="statrow rv">
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-v" data-num="6" data-suffix="M+">6M+</div><div class="stat-l">Users across products</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-v" data-num="90" data-prefix="$" data-suffix="M+">$90M+</div><div class="stat-l">Raised by products I designed</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-v" data-num="30" data-suffix="+">30+</div><div class="stat-l">Products shipped</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-v" data-num="8" data-suffix="+">8+</div><div class="stat-l">Years of design experience</div></div>
  </div>
    <div class="record-outro rv">
    <p>The numbers are the short version.</p>
    <a class="btn-text" href="/about">The full story, village to here <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 12L12 4M5 4h7v7"/></svg></a>
